<div class="space-y-8">
  <div class="space-y-2">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">Fanfarr</h1>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground">
      Theme music for your Plex library.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6 space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true" />
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-card-foreground">Running</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      The service is up and its database is reachable. The dashboard is not built yet
      &mdash; there is no library sync, no Plex connection and nothing to configure.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
      <a
        href="/health"
        class="inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md border border-border px-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground transition-colors"
      >
        Health endpoint
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/dyonng/fanfarr"
        class="inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-3 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
      >
        Source
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-4">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">Library</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-card-foreground">&mdash;</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-4">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">With themes</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-card-foreground">&mdash;</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-4">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">Missing</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-card-foreground">&mdash;</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
